Alembic migrations for Faxbot API.
Use DATABASE_URL to target your database. Example:

# Tell alembic to treat the DB as being at revision 0001_initial (skip re-running it)
  cd api
  alembic -c alembic.ini stamp 0001_initial
  export DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg2://user:pass@host:5432/db
  alembic -c alembic.ini upgrade head

